@c MASTER MENU
@node Top
@top Overview

This software is a command-line program and accompanying library
to generate API documentation for
@url{https://www.gnu.org/software/guile/, GNU Guile} Scheme projects.
You can find additional information in
@url{https://codeberg.org/luis-felipe/guile-documenta, Guile Documentá's website}.

Note that a copy of this documentation should also be available locally
in your device, in @code{info} format, once you install the program. You
can browse it with any info reader. For example:

@example
$ info guile-documenta
@end example

Guile Documentá is a
@url{https://freedomdefined.org/Definition, Free Cultural Work}
(@pxref{Copying Information}).

(The word @emph{documentá} is an imperative form of the Spanish verb
@emph{documentar}, which means @emph{to document}.)


